function agentMarkup(a,i){const c=caseBy(a.caseId);return `<article class="agent-tile ${cls(a)} ${i===2?'hero':''} ${a.status==='working'?'is-working':''}" data-agent-tile="${a.id}"><button class="screen-open" data-action="open-agent" data-id="${a.id}" aria-label="Open ${esc(a.name)} — ${provider(a)}">${preview(a)}</button><button class="identity-grip" data-action="open-agent" data-id="${a.id}"><span class="provider-dot"></span>${esc(a.name)} <span class="quiet">/ ${provider(a)}</span></button>${c?`<button class="case-tab" data-action="open-case" data-id="${c.id}">${icon('folder')} ${esc(c.title)}</button>`:`<button class="case-tab" data-action="new-task" data-id="${a.id}">${icon('plus')} Give a task</button>`}</article>`}
